  <rms:rms_project_0_description>Blind Navigation Assistant â€” AI-Powered Accessibility Application
Developing an Android accessibility application using Kotlin to assist visually impaired users through computer vision, voice interaction, location services, and emergency assistance.
Implemented an on-device computer vision pipeline using YOLO11 models with ONNX Runtime and TensorFlow Lite, including object detection, bounding-box processing, confidence filtering, distance estimation, and threat classification.
Integrated CameraX for camera processing and dedicated ML components for detected-object representation, distance estimation, and object detection.
Built voice-command interaction with command parsing for navigation, location queries, obstacle history, torch control, detection control, speech-speed adjustment, and emergency actions.
Integrated location-based navigation using Google Play Services Maps/Location and implemented dedicated navigation and location management components.
Added emergency SOS and fall-detection components, including guardian contact management and accelerometer-based fall-event handling.
Developed Python-based simulation and inference pipelines to evaluate object detection, spatial positioning, estimated distance, threat levels, walking-corridor filtering, voice intents, and emergency scenarios.</rms:rms_project_0_description>
  <rms:rms_project_0_organization>Main Project</rms:rms_project_0_organization>
  <rms:rms_project_0_title>Blind Navigation Assistant â€“ AI-Powered Accessibility Application</rms:rms_project_0_title>
  <rms:rms_project_1_description>VOICE â€” Full-Stack Music Streaming Platform
Developed a full-stack music streaming platform using React, Vite, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and Mongoose, providing a responsive interface for discovering, streaming, and managing music.
Implemented secure JWT-based authentication with access and refresh token management, protecting user-specific resources and API endpoints.
Built core music platform functionality including audio streaming, song search, likes, playlist creation and management, and genre-based content discovery.
Developed a creator studio enabling creators to upload and manage songs and associated artwork, using Cloudinary for cloud-based media storage and delivery.
Implemented play-count tracking and analytics to record listening activity and provide insights into song engagement.
Added genre-based recommendation functionality to improve music discovery and personalize the listening experience.
Designed and integrated RESTful APIs between the React frontend and Express backend for authentication, users, songs, playlists, likes, uploads, and analytics.
Structured the backend using Mongoose models and modular API logic to manage relationships between users, songs, playlists, and creator data.
Deployed the application using Vercel for the frontend and Railway for the backend, with MongoDB Atlas serving as the cloud database.</rms:rms_project_1_description>
  <rms:rms_project_1_organization>Self learning</rms:rms_project_1_organization>
  <rms:rms_project_1_title>Voice</rms:rms_project_1_title>
  <rms:rms_project_1_url>https://voice-h8h059roz-poojithsmenon-3636s-projects.vercel.app/</rms:rms_project_1_url>
  <rms:rms_project_2_description>GODVALLEY â€” Full-Stack E-Commerce Web Application
Developed a full-stack e-commerce platform using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB, with separate frontend and backend components.
Implemented user registration and authentication, enabling users to securely access the application&#39;s shopping functionality.
Built product browsing and shopping cart functionality, allowing users to select products and manage their purchases.
Developed a complete checkout and order-placement workflow, with order information persistently stored in MongoDB.
Designed RESTful API endpoints for users, products, orders, contact messages, and analytics, connecting frontend functionality with backend services.
Built an administrative management interface for monitoring and updating customer orders and managing user-submitted contact information.
Implemented order analytics, including total orders, revenue, pending orders, and delivered orders, to provide administrators with an overview of platform activity.
Deployed the frontend using Netlify and the backend using Render, with MongoDB used for persistent application data.</rms:rms_project_2_description>
  <rms:rms_project_2_organization>Self learning</rms:rms_project_2_organization>
  <rms:rms_project_2_title>GODVALLEY</rms:rms_project_2_title>
  <rms:rms_project_2_url>https://splendorous-quokka-dfa54d.netlify.app/</rms:rms_project_2_url>
