  <rms:rms_skill_count>4</rms:rms_skill_count>
  <rms:rms_summary>Aspiring software developer with strong proficiency in C++ and hands-on experience building full-stack web and Android applications. Experienced with Python, Kotlin, JavaScript, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and Git, with additional exposure to computer vision and AI through YOLO11-based development. Strong interest in software engineering, problem solving, and building practical technology solutions, with a focus on continuously expanding technical expertise.</rms:rms_summary>
  <rms:rms_teaching_count>0</rms:rms_teaching_count>
 </rdf:Description>

